{
  "info": {
    "name": "LAVO — Stations API",
    "description": "Collection pour les endpoints liés aux stations de lavage.\n\nVariable requise : `base_url` (ex: http://localhost:3000)\nVariable auto-remplie : `access_token` (depuis la collection Auth)\n\n## Groupes\n- **Station Onboarding** : inscription station en 3 étapes (validate/step1, validate/step2, submit)\n- **Station — Profil** : lecture du profil station authentifiée",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Station Onboarding",
      "description": "Flux en 3 etapes. Les endpoints validate/* ne font aucune ecriture en base — ils permettent au frontend de valider chaque etape avant de passer a la suivante. Toutes les operations DB sont declenchees uniquement par /submit.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "validate/step1 — succes (200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": [],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/stations/onboarding/validate/step1",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "stations",
                "onboarding",
                "validate",
                "step1"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"email\":\"station@example.com\",\"phone\":\"+33612345678\",\"password\":\"StationPass1!\",\"confirm_password\":\"StationPass1!\"}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Valide les champs step 1 sans ecriture en base. Aucun compte n'est cree."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "validate/step1 — confirm_password invalide (400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
                  "pm.test('Erreur confirm_password', () => {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.code).to.eql('VALIDATION_FAILED');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.errors.some(e => e.field === 'confirm_password')).to.be.true;",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": [],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/stations/onboarding/validate/step1",
